    "frames": [
      {
        "slide": 1,
        "role": "cover",
        "subject": "A tilt-up plant wall at night from crane height, five door openings receding right. Four bays glow warm under pendant lamps, one holding the covered car on a carrier and one a white enclosure. The fifth is black, its shutter part lowered, two work lamps and blue tape on its threshold. A floodlit apron runs below with a lane line, joints, a bollard and a worker.",
        "visual_consequence": "Four warm openings against one black opening. Without the headline every bay but the last is running, the table's status column as light, readable at 432 px.",
        "weakness": "Polish only. The covered car's hem reads as a dark serrated band at native size. The lit bays' back walls are broad empty planes. The bollard and worker casts are short pools.",
        "repair": "none required",
        "encoding_reads": true,
        "dominant_subject_finished": true,
        "feed_legible": true,
